  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Two parsing/data-model correctness fixes, primarily benefiting XSLT. (1) The namespace:: axis now returns inherited namespace nodes for parsed elements: it walks the ancestor chain (honouring xmlns=\"\" undeclarations and the copy-namespaces no-inherit marker) so element/namespace::* reports the complete in-scope set, matching fn:in-scope-prefixes; constructed elements are unchanged. (2) A raw & is now accepted in an XPath string literal when the host opts in via XQueryParserFacade.AllowRawAmpersand — XPath (unlike XQuery) has no entity references, so an &amp; in a stylesheet is decoded to a literal & before the XPath text reaches the parser; strict XQuery is unchanged (flag defaults off). Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.2.2. Backward-compatible; no public API removed. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
